# Line endings are LF in the repository and LF in the working tree, on
# every machine.
#
# Not a style preference: this project is edited from Windows, from a
# Linux VM and by more than one assistant, and an editor that saved CRLF
# once turned five untouched files into a 374-line "change" that hid the
# real edits inside it. `text=auto eol=lf` makes git normalise on the way
# in AND check out LF, so the working tree cannot drift again.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touched, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.tgz binary
*.zip binary
